		<title>By: Ma’abud Charles McClelland</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=762&#038;cpage=1#comment-26059</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ma’abud Charles McClelland]]></dc:creator>
